# The market-data and gateway images build with `context: ../services` so the
# shared common-go module is available. Exclude everything not needed by those
# Go builds to keep the build context small.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/target
**/.venv
**/.venv-verify
**/.pytest_cache
**/__pycache__
**/*.log
market-data/market-data
gateway/gateway
ledger-core/
risk-engine/
dashboard/
